Consumer behaviour is changing with the increased use of technology in cars. How can you improve a customer's information experience of the car?

ConnectNeXT is an infotainment and telematics platform that allows users to control the infotainment system, troubleshoot common vehicle problems, improve driving, and get assistance in case of emergency. It was the first indigenous smart-car platform in the Indian automotive market.

[Case Study](http://rohitg.in/portfolio/works/connectnext.html)
